 "about": "Centrifuge modelled as a generic product: rounded body with sloped front, round domed lid with window and rear hinge, control panel with display, start, stop and lid-release keys, side vents, mains switch and 4 feet. Sits on a bench top (z = 0). Water, drainage, gases and extract reach this item via the nested shared FMC_P_MechEq_ServicePoint (Medical Equipment cannot hold pipe or duct connectors). Reference: query: centrifuge bench medical equipment hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=centrifuge+bench+medical+equipment+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review; photo: https://www.thomassci.com/p/rotofix-32a-benchtop-centrifuge; photo_title: Hettich Rotofix 32A Benchtop Centrifuge; photo_kind: supplier",
